    "mechanism": "高分辨质谱同时定量%p-tau217与Aβ42/40比值，输出淀粉样病理概率评分（APS2）",
    "status": "已获批",
    "sample": "血浆",
    "finding": "【监管状态】C2N Diagnostics的PrecivityAD2（APS2，淀粉样蛋白概率评分2）于2026年8月获FDA批准，是首个获批用于40岁及以上症状性成年人的AD血液检测，采用高分辨质谱同时测定%p-tau217与Aβ42/40比值。【关键性能】关键队列n=1142例症状性受试者：阳性预测值97.6%、阴性预测值93.1%；17.3%落入中间区（\"可能阳性\"，PPV 77.3%）；性能在不同年龄层及12种合并症（含慢性肾病、糖尿病、房颤）中保持稳定；开发队列AUC 0.94（Meyer等，Alzheimers Dement TRCI 2024）。【设计意义】同时给出\"淀粉样蛋白概率评分\"而非单纯阴阳，便于临床分层与随访。｜【证据1·Alzheimer's & dementia : the journal of the Alzheimer's Association 2024】(PMID 38491912) The area under the receiver operating characteristic curve (AUC-ROC) for %p-tau217 (0.94) was statistically significantly higher than that for p-tau217 concentration (0.91). High-throughput, mass spectrometry-based assays were used to measure %p-tau217 and amyloid beta (Aβ)42/40 ratio in blood samples from 583 individuals with suspected AD (53% positron emission tomography [PET] positive by Centiloid > 25).｜【证据2·Neurology. Clinical practice 2025】(PMID 41070139) Model performance was optimized using 2 cutpoints, 1 for high and 1 for low likelihood of PET positivity, to attain ≥90% specificity and sensitivity. For the intended-use cohort (46.0% prevalence of PET positivity), a combination of Aβ42/40, ptau-217, and APOE4 allele count provided the best model with a receiver operating characteristic area under the curve of 0.942 and with 2 cutpoints fixed at 91% sensitivity and 91% specificity, yielding a…｜【证据3·Annals of clinical and translational neurology 2023】(PMID 36975407) In a subset of the dataset aligned with the Intended Use population (patients aged 60 and older with CDR ≥0.5), the pre-established APS algorithm predicted amyloid PET with a sensitivity of 84.9% (CI: 72.9-92.1%) and specificity of 96% (CI: 80.5-99.3%), exclusive of 13 individuals for whom the te… This study aimed to provide additional independent evidence that the pre-established APS algorithm, along with its cutoff values, discriminates between amyloid positive and negative individuals.",
